# ==============================================================================
# 🌌 Starward Space - Global Git Ignore Policy
# 安全与脱敏第一准则：绝对不让任何生产密码、私钥、本地环境配置进入代码仓库
# ==============================================================================

# --- [1] 安全与敏感机密文件 (TOP PRIORITY - 防黑客/防同学探测) ---
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.cert
*.crt
*.p12
*.pfx
*secret*
*credentials*
id_rsa*

# Spring Boot 生产环境机密配置脱敏 (本地开发用 application-dev.yml，生产用环境变量注入)
application-prod.yml
application-prod.properties
application-secret.yml
application-secret.properties

# --- [2] 操作系统与编辑器临时文件 ---
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
ehthumbs.db
Thumbs.db

# JetBrains / IntelliJ IDEA
.idea/
*.iml
*.iws
*.ipr
out/

# VS Code
.vscode/
!.vscode/settings.json
!.vscode/tasks.json
!.vscode/launch.json
!.vscode/extensions.json
*.code-workspace

# --- [3] Java & Maven 编译产物 ---
**/target/
**/*.class
*.jar
*.war
*.ear
*.zip
*.tar.gz
*.rar
hs_err_pid*
replay_pid*

# --- [4] Node.js & 前端构建产物 (Vue 3 / Vite) ---
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/dist-ssr/
**/.vite/
*.local
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# --- [5] 日志与数据库持久化文件 ---
logs/
*.log
*.log.*
*.sqlite
*.db
